abstract: "A standalone written component classification with exact enumeration and cube/Walsh verification of 30,240 five-cycle forms. The fourteen-variable Boolean degree/sensitivity problem remains open. Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; human review, formal verification, and novelty are not established."
